<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.</p>

<p>I'm sorry to hear about your recent experience — we want your journey with us to be comfortable and enjoyable every time you fly.<br />
<br />
Our crew will always try to move you at your request if your comfort is being impacted, however, sometimes alternative seating options are limited, especially if a flight is completely full.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I've passed your comments on to the relevant team for review.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
